  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><span class=\"noexcerpt\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin-top:0.2em; margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><div style=\"margin-left:1.6em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This article is about an outpost. This name is also used for a <a href=\"/wiki/Kodonur_Crossroads\" title=\"Kodonur Crossroads\">mission</a>&#32;and&#32;a <a href=\"/wiki/Kodonur_Crossroads_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Kodonur Crossroads (Zaishen quest)\">Zaishen mission quest</a>.</i></div></div></span>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Kodonur Crossroads\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Kodonur_Crossroads.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Kodonur Crossroads.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/8/8d/Kodonur_Crossroads.jpg/196px-Kodonur_Crossroads.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/8/8d/Kodonur_Crossroads.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Kourna\" title=\"Kourna\">Kourna</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Dejarin_Estate\" title=\"Dejarin Estate\">Dejarin Estate</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Jahai_Bluffs\" title=\"Jahai Bluffs\">Jahai Bluffs</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/The_Floodplain_of_Mahnkelon\" title=\"The Floodplain of Mahnkelon\">The Floodplain of Mahnkelon</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Kodonur_Crossroads_world_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Kodonur Crossroads world map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/9/9c/Kodonur_Crossroads_world_map.jpg/196px-Kodonur_Crossroads_world_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"170\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9c/Kodonur_Crossroads_world_map.jpg/294px-Kodonur_Crossroads_world_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9c/Kodonur_Crossroads_world_map.jpg/392px-Kodonur_Crossroads_world_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"718\" data-file-height=\"623\" /></a><br /><small>On the world map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Kodonur_Crossroads_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Kodonur Crossroads inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/ec/Kodonur_Crossroads_inside.jpg/196px-Kodonur_Crossroads_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ec/Kodonur_Crossroads_inside.jpg/294px-Kodonur_Crossroads_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ec/Kodonur_Crossroads_inside.jpg/392px-Kodonur_Crossroads_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"750\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>At the crossroads of Kodonur, no one will speak ill of <a href=\"/wiki/Warmarshal_Varesh\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Warmarshal Varesh\">Warmarshal Varesh</a>; her tight control over trade has made the merchants here rich. Come for the bargains, stay for the excellent security measures. Just don't get too rowdy, or you may find yourself on the receiving end of Varesh's famed law and order.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Kodonur Crossroads</b> is a Kournan outpost relatively well-outfitted with merchants and traders. It is the main trading center of Kourna.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Exits\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exits</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Collectors_and_crafters\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Collectors and crafters</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Henchmen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Henchmen</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Merchants_and_Traders\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Merchants and Traders</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Other_services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other services</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Other_allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other allies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Kodonur_Crossroads_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">primary quest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Centaur_Blackmail\" title=\"Centaur Blackmail\">Centaur Blackmail</a> leads to this outpost.\n</p><p>Alternatively, travel to the southeastern corner of <a href=\"/wiki/Jahai_Bluffs\" title=\"Jahai Bluffs\">Jahai Bluffs</a>. <sup style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">[<a href=\"/wiki/Talk:Kodonur_Crossroads_(outpost)\" title=\"Talk:Kodonur Crossroads (outpost)\"><span title=\"Talk:Kodonur Crossroads (outpost)\"><i>verification requested</i></span></a>]</sup> You will still need to complete the aforementioned quest in order to start the <a href=\"/wiki/Kodonur_Crossroads\" title=\"Kodonur Crossroads\">associated mission</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exits\">Exits</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Kodonur_Crossroads_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Exits\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dejarin_Estate\" title=\"Dejarin Estate\">Dejarin Estate</a> (south)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Jahai_Bluffs\" title=\"Jahai Bluffs\">Jahai Bluffs</a> (northwest)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Floodplain_of_Mahnkelon\" title=\"The Floodplain of Mahnkelon\">The Floodplain of Mahnkelon</a> (northeast)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Kodonur_Crossroads_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Kodonur_Crossroads_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Kodonur_Crossroads_(outpost)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Collectors_and_crafters\">Collectors and crafters</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket