com/wiki/Main_Page\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"gw2:Main Page\">Guild Wars 2 Wiki</a>  has an article on <i><b><a href=\"https://wiki.guildwars2.com/wiki/Kodonur_Crossing\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"gw2:Kodonur Crossing\">Kodonur Crossing</a></b></i>.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/World_map\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"World map\">world map</a> actually marks this location with the icon for an outpost upon initial arrival. It changes into the icon for a mission outpost only upon completion of the quest that precedes the <a href=\"/wiki/Kodonur_Crossroads\" title=\"Kodonur Crossroads\">Kodonur Crossroads mission</a>, which is <a href=\"/wiki/Centaur_Blackmail\" title=\"Centaur Blackmail\">Centaur Blackmail</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; font-size:90%; width:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#BAE; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kourna#Towns_and_outposts\" title=\"Kourna\">Towns and outposts in Kourna</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sunspear_Sanctuary\" title=\"Sunspear Sanctuary\">Sunspear Sanctuary</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Hojanu\" title=\"Camp Hojanu\">Camp Hojanu</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dajkah_Inlet_(outpost)\" title=\"Dajkah Inlet (outpost)\">Dajkah Inlet</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Kodonur Crossroads</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moddok_Crevice_(outpost)\" title=\"Moddok Crevice (outpost)\">Moddok Crevice</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nundu_Bay_(outpost)\" title=\"Nundu Bay (outpost)\">Nundu Bay</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pogahn_Passage_(outpost)\" title=\"Pogahn Passage (outpost)\">Pogahn Pa